flowchart TD
 A["Suspected endocrine problem"] --> B{"Structural or functional?"}
 B -->|"STRUCTURAL — a mass"| C{"Benign or malignant?"}
 C --> D{"Does the enlargement itself<br/>cause clinical effects?"}
 D --> E["Mass effect:<br/>pituitary → optic chiasm, CN III/IV/VI, V1/V2<br/>thyroid → dysphagia"]
 B -->|"FUNCTIONAL — hormone"| F{"Too much or too little?"}
 F -->|"EXCESS"| G["Try to SUPPRESS it<br/>→ suppression test"]
 F -->|"DEFICIENCY"| H["Try to STIMULATE it<br/>→ stimulation test"]
 G --> I{"Primary, secondary/tertiary,<br/>or exogenous source?"}
 H --> I

flowchart TD
